{"4574850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Escape the Exomoon", "steam_appid": 4574850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5000580], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ESCAPE THE EXOMOON is a narrative driven cyberpunk sci-fi horror game. Hack, hide, and fight your way across an abandoned space colony and learn the terrifying secrets within. Will you sacrifice your sanity for survival?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574850/extras/dce7ae3f7cb19f8cfa6ed54e55b19a52.poster.avif?t=1787093564\" width=1080 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574850/extras/dce7ae3f7cb19f8cfa6ed54e55b19a52.webm?t=1787093564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574850/extras/dce7ae3f7cb19f8cfa6ed54e55b19a52.mp4?t=1787093564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last survivor of the EXO CORP. space colony, every day is a struggle for survival for Ky. Just as he begins to lose hope, he hears a  voice calling out for help through the speakers of a security drone. She offers a seemingly simple trade: get her out from the depths of the abandoned facility  and maybe together they can find a way off this rock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574850/extras/b263cfe12890e2e7b44952ca59f204a2.poster.avif?t=1787093564\" width=1080 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574850/extras/b263cfe12890e2e7b44952ca59f204a2.webm?t=1787093564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574850/extras/b263cfe12890e2e7b44952ca59f204a2.mp4?t=1787093564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, as he journeys across the surface of Opus, Ky will learn the dark secrets underneath his only home and make difficult decisions that may determine the fate of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574850/extras/3cadc4dc5f72fdbccaff1fc56511a573.avif?t=1787093564\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your humanity will determine the choices you can make and the direction of the story. Install upgrades in the form of cybernetics and body modifications using resources you've collected. However, these come with worsening side effects including paranoia, dissociation, aggression, and apathy. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574850/extras/d3371d2a8e829148c8273b3c61a54c06.avif?t=1787093564\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your tech skills to hack into facility systems, you can open new paths for exploration, solve puzzles, and discover clues of what led to the demise of Opus.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574850/extras/3e3c5d871edebe0fc9189cf89713846d.avif?t=1787093564\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're nearly powerless against the terrifying army of  security robots  and creatures that have taken over in EXO's absence. In order to survive, you will need to sneak your way past cameras and enemies while intelligently utilizing the environment and your drone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574850/extras/0f27ebdd10c9d192b5a0d6b8b6761c5f.avif?t=1787093564\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></h2></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all other options are exhausted,  use your limited weapons or  the facility's left over technology to defend yourself  and gain an advantage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic graphics and a fully voiced narrative </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings depending on player decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep lore uncovered through notes, audio logs, and hacking computers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternative play styles (stealth vs direct combat)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics, platforming, and logic puzzles with a variety of possible solutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original synthwave score</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>No generative AI was used in the development of this game.</i></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>ESCAPE THE EXOMOON is a narrative driven cyberpunk sci-fi horror game. Hack, hide, and fight your way across an abandoned space colony and learn the terrifying secrets within. Will you sacrifice your sanity for survival?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574850/extras/dce7ae3f7cb19f8cfa6ed54e55b19a52.poster.avif?t=1787093564\" width=1080 heig