=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic graphics and a fully voiced narrative </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings depending on player decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep lore uncovered through notes, audio logs, and hacking computers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternative play styles (stealth vs direct combat)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics, platforming, and logic puzzles with a variety of possible solutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original synthwave score</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>No generative AI was used in the development of this game.</i></h2>", "short_description": "ESCAPE THE EXOMOON is a narrative driven cyberpunk sci-fi horror game. Hack, hide, and fight your way across an abandoned space colony and learn the terrifying secrets within. Will you sacrifice your sanity for survival?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574850/767681e674106c369b1932ba3b0712499698332b/header.jpg?t=1787093564", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574850/cf9c58665761f9054a21fd339df194dc332f2115/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787093564", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4574850/cf9c58665761f9054a21fd339df194dc332f2115/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787093564", "website": "https://lolightgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 x64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or Amd Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super or AMD Radeon RX VEGA 56<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Stor